    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d512">

                <pb facs="0690" n="576" xml:id="pg576"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/2476: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morales</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-09-16T11:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                                1922—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received September 18—9:20
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>76. Revolutionary movement headed by Francisco Martínez Funes completely
                    overthrown. Government forces killing 56 and capturing 78 men. Government in
                    full control of the situation.</p>
                <p>The President requests that the <hi rendition="#italic">Tacoma</hi> remain at
                    Truxillo for several days.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morales</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
